<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Symmetric Cryptography Database</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+SemiCondensed:wght@400;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css?v=__CACHE_TOKEN__" />
    <script src="data.js?v=__CACHE_TOKEN__" defer></script>
    <script src="app.js?v=__CACHE_TOKEN__" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <header class="top-header panel">
        <section class="hero">
          <h1>Symmetric Cryptography Database</h1>
          <button type="button" class="nav-burger" id="navBurger" aria-label="Toggle navigation menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navigator">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </button>
        </section>
        <nav class="navigator" id="navigator" aria-label="Section navigation">
          <div class="nav-group" aria-label="Views">
            <span class="nav-group-label">Views</span>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab is-active" data-view-target="visualizations">Timelines</button>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="genealogy">Genealogy</button>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-group" aria-label="Tables">
            <span class="nav-group-label">Tables</span>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="tables">All SQLite Tables</button>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="builder">Custom Query Builder</button>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-group" aria-label="Documentation">
            <span class="nav-group-label">Documentation</span>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="about">About</button>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="glossary">Glossary</button>
            <button type="button" class="nav-tab" data-view-target="disclaimer">Disclaimer</button>
          </div>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="panel view-panel is-active" data-view="visualizations">
        <div class="view-header-row">
          <div class="view-header-title">
            <h2>Timelines</h2>
            <span id="vizFamilyCount" class="viz-count-badge"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="view-header-actions">
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-filters="viz">Hide filters</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-layout="viz" aria-pressed="false">Filters on left</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-fullscreen-target="visualizations">Fullscreen</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note view-description">X axis = publication year. Y axis grouping is selectable.</p>
        <div class="view-body" id="vizViewBody">
        <div id="vizControlsWrap" class="view-controls-wrap">
        <div class="filter-sections-bar">
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-collapse-all="viz">Collapse all</button>
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-expand-all="viz">Expand all</button>
        </div>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Plot controls</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
        <div class="toolbar viz-toolbar">
          <label class="toolbar-field">Group families by
            <select id="vizGroupBy">
              <option value="type">Type</option>
              <option value="construction">Construction</option>
              <option value="target">Target application</option>
              <option value="process">Process</option>
              <option value="none">None</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <div class="viz-display-group">
            <div class="viz-name-section">
              <span class="viz-name-section-label">Names</span>
              <div class="viz-name-mode" role="group"><button id="vizNameOff" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Off</button><button id="vizNameClip" type="button" class="name-mode-btn is-active">Clip</button><button id="vizNameWrap" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Wrap</button><button id="vizNameFull" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Full</button></div>
            </div>
            <div class="viz-name-section">
              <span class="viz-name-section-label">Font size</span>
              <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="vizFontMinus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">A-</button><button id="vizFontPlus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">A+</button><button id="vizFontReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Reset</button><span id="vizFontValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">12px</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="viz-name-section">
              <span class="viz-name-section-label">Plot zoom</span>
              <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="vizZoomOut" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">-</button><button id="vizZoomIn" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">+</button><button id="vizZoomReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">100%</button><button id="vizZoomFit" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Fit</button><span id="vizZoomValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">100%</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="viz-name-section">
              <span class="viz-name-section-label">Year spacing</span>
              <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="vizColMinus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">-</button><button id="vizColPlus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">+</button><button id="vizColReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Reset</button><span id="vizColSpacingValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">+0px</span></div>
            </div>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="vizCollapseGroups" type="checkbox" checked /> Collapse to <input id="vizCollapseCount" type="number" min="1" value="3" class="viz-collapse-count" /></label>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="vizHideDots" type="checkbox" /> Bullet points</label>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="vizColorByProcess" type="checkbox" checked /> Color by process</label>
            <button id="vizDownloadPng" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Download PNG</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-secondary-controls">
          <label class="toolbar-field viz-search-field">Find family
            <input id="vizFamilySearch" type="search" placeholder="Type a family name" autocomplete="off" />
          </label>
          <label class="inline-check" title="When checked, matches only the whole word (e.g. &quot;DES&quot; won't match &quot;HADES&quot;)"><input id="vizFamilySearchExact" type="checkbox" /> Exact word</label>
          <div class="viz-year-controls">
            <label class="toolbar-field">From year
              <input id="vizYearStart" type="range" />
            </label>
            <label class="toolbar-field">To year
              <input id="vizYearEnd" type="range" />
            </label>
            <button id="vizYearReset" type="button">Reset years</button>
            <span id="vizYearRangeValue" class="small-note">All years</span>
          </div>
        </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Family filters</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
        <div id="vizTierFilterPanel"></div>
          </div>
        </details>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-frame" id="vizFrame">
          <button type="button" id="vizControlsHideToggle" class="frame-controls-hide-toggle" data-toggle-frame-controls="viz" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Hide the floating buttons overlaying the plot" title="Hide the floating buttons overlaying the plot"></button>
          <div id="vizYAxisPane" class="viz-yaxis-pane">
            <div id="vizYAxisTrack" class="viz-axis-track">
              <svg id="familyVizYAxis" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="viz-plot-pane">
            <div id="vizPlotScroll" class="viz-plot-scroll">
              <svg id="familyVizPlot" role="img" aria-label="Family timeline visualization"></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="viz-xaxis-pane">
              <div id="vizXAxisTrack" class="viz-axis-track">
                <svg id="familyVizXAxis" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="vizCornerPane" class="viz-corner-pane"></div>
          <div class="fullscreen-zoom-controls">
            <button type="button" id="vizFsZoomOut" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
            <button type="button" id="vizFsZoomFit" aria-label="Fit to screen">Fit</button>
            <button type="button" id="vizFsZoomIn" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="vizParamsToggle" class="gen-params-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="vizParamsPanel">Tune layout</button>
          <div id="vizParamsPanel" class="gen-params-panel" hidden>
            <div class="gen-params-panel-head">
              <strong>Layout tuning</strong>
              <button type="button" id="vizParamsClose" class="gen-params-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
            </div>
            <div class="gen-params-row">
              <span class="gen-params-label" title="Vertical spacing between points stacked within the same row/group">Row spacing</span>
              <input id="vizParamStackStep" type="range" min="15" max="80" step="1" />
              <span id="vizParamStackStepValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">34%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gen-params-row">
              <span class="gen-params-label" title="Extra vertical gap inserted between groups/rows">Group gap</span>
              <input id="vizParamGroupGap" type="range" min="10" max="120" step="1" />
              <span id="vizParamGroupGapValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">42%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gen-params-actions">
              <button type="button" id="vizParamsReset" class="name-mode-btn">Reset spacing</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
        <p id="vizRelationInfo" class="small-note viz-relation-info">Hover or tap a family dot/label or a relation arrow to see details. Use the zoom controls, pinch, or Cmd/Ctrl + wheel inside the plot to adjust scale.</p>
        <div id="vizProcessLegend" class="viz-process-legend" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel view-panel" data-view="genealogy">
        <div class="view-header-row">
          <div class="view-header-title">
            <h2>Genealogy</h2>
            <span id="genFamilyCount" class="viz-count-badge"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="view-header-actions">
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-filters="gen">Hide filters</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-layout="gen" aria-pressed="false">Filters on left</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-fullscreen-target="genealogy">Fullscreen</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note view-description">Design lineage and influence graph. Arrows flow from ancestor (top) to descendant (bottom); generation depth determined by the longest influence path.</p>
        <div class="view-body" id="genViewBody">
        <div id="genControlsWrap" class="view-controls-wrap">
        <div class="filter-sections-bar">
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-collapse-all="gen">Collapse all</button>
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-expand-all="gen">Expand all</button>
        </div>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Plot controls</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
        <div class="toolbar viz-toolbar">
          <div class="viz-display-group">
            <div class="viz-name-section">
              <span class="viz-name-section-label">Layout</span>
              <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="genLayoutLayered" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Layered</button><button id="genLayoutRadial" type="button" class="name-mode-btn is-active">Radial</button></div>
            </div>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="genConnectedOnly" type="checkbox" checked /> Only connected families</label>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="genStandardsOnly" type="checkbox" /> Standards only</label>
            <label class="inline-check"><input id="genByGeneration" type="checkbox" checked /> By generation</label>
            <button id="genDownloadPng" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Download PNG</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-secondary-controls">
          <label class="toolbar-field viz-search-field">Find family
            <input id="genFamilySearch" type="search" placeholder="Type a family name, or right-click/long-press a node" autocomplete="off" />
          </label>
          <label class="inline-check" title="When checked, matches only the whole word (e.g. &quot;DES&quot; won't match &quot;HADES&quot;)"><input id="genFamilySearchExact" type="checkbox" /> Exact word</label>
          <label class="toolbar-field" title="How many relation hops from the matched family to also show (0 = only the matched family itself)">Relation degree
            <div class="viz-name-mode">
              <button id="genDegreeMinus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">-</button>
              <input id="genFamilySearchDegree" type="number" min="0" value="1" style="width:3em" />
              <button id="genDegreePlus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">+</button>
            </div>
          </label>
          <div class="viz-year-controls">
            <label class="toolbar-field">From year
              <input id="genYearStart" type="range" />
            </label>
            <label class="toolbar-field">To year
              <input id="genYearEnd" type="range" />
            </label>
            <button id="genYearReset" type="button">Reset years</button>
            <span id="genYearRangeValue" class="small-note">All years</span>
          </div>
        </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Family filters</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
        <div id="genTierFilterPanel"></div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Relation filters</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
        <div id="genRelationFilterPanel"></div>
          </div>
        </details>
        </div>
        <div class="gen-frame" id="genFrame">
          <button type="button" id="genControlsHideToggle" class="frame-controls-hide-toggle" data-toggle-frame-controls="gen" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Hide the floating buttons overlaying the plot" title="Hide the floating buttons overlaying the plot"></button>
          <div id="genPlotScroll" class="gen-plot-scroll">
            <svg id="genPlot" role="img" aria-label="Genealogy influence graph"></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fullscreen-zoom-controls">
            <button type="button" id="genFsZoomOut" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
            <button type="button" id="genFsZoomFit" aria-label="Fit to screen">Fit</button>
            <button type="button" id="genFsZoomIn" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="genParamsToggle" class="gen-params-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="genParamsPanel">Tune layout</button>
          <div id="genParamsPanel" class="gen-params-panel" hidden>
            <div class="gen-params-panel-head">
              <strong>Layout tuning</strong>
              <button type="button" id="genParamsClose" class="gen-params-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
            </div>
            <div id="genParamsCommon" class="gen-params-group gen-params-common">
              <label class="toolbar-field">Color nodes by
                <select id="genColorBy">
                  <option value="type">Type</option>
                  <option value="process">Process</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <div class="viz-name-section" title="Most families have more than one Construction or Target application, so coloring by either would be arbitrary (only the alphabetically-first value would show) -- highlighting a chosen subset instead fades everything else out without hiding it.">
                <span class="viz-name-section-label">Highlight</span>
                <div class="viz-name-mode">
                  <select id="genHighlightBy">
                    <option value="none">None</option>
                    <option value="construction">Construction</option>
                    <option value="target">Target application</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div id="genHighlightValues" class="filter-checklist viz-filter-checklist" hidden></div>
              </div>
              <div class="viz-name-section">
                <span class="viz-name-section-label">Names</span>
                <div class="viz-name-mode" role="group"><button id="genNameClip" type="button" class="name-mode-btn is-active">Clip</button><button id="genNameFull" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Full</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="viz-name-section">
                <span class="viz-name-section-label">Number of Chars</span>
                <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="genRadiusMinus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">−</button><button id="genRadiusPlus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">+</button><button id="genRadiusReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Reset</button><span id="genRadiusValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">8ch</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="viz-name-section">
                <span class="viz-name-section-label">Font size</span>
                <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="genFontMinus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">A-</button><button id="genFontPlus" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">A+</button><button id="genFontReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Reset</button><span id="genFontValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">12px</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="viz-name-section">
                <span class="viz-name-section-label">Plot zoom</span>
                <div class="viz-name-mode"><button id="genZoomOut" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">-</button><button id="genZoomIn" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">+</button><button id="genZoomReset" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">100%</button><button id="genZoomFit" type="button" class="name-mode-btn">Fit</button><span id="genZoomValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">100%</span></div>
              </div>
              <label class="inline-check"><input id="genShowBullets" type="checkbox" /> Show bullets</label>
              <label class="inline-check"><input id="genCollapseEdges" type="checkbox" /> Collapse edges</label>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label" title="Relation edges default to less than fully opaque so overlapping edges don't bury family labels; hovering or clicking an edge always shows it at full strength regardless of this setting">Edge opacity</span>
                <input id="genParamEdgeOpacity" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="5" />
                <span id="genParamEdgeOpacityValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">10%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <hr class="gen-params-sep" />
            <div id="genParamsRadial" class="gen-params-group">
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label" title="Minimum arc a label needs before its ring counts as crowded">Label spacing</span>
                <input id="genParamLabelPitch" type="range" min="50" max="300" step="5" />
                <span id="genParamLabelPitchValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">125%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label" title="How strongly a crowded ring is pulled toward even spacing (0 = off, 100 = fully even)">Even-spacing strength</span>
                <input id="genParamAlphaMax" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" />
                <span id="genParamAlphaMaxValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">80%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="genParamsLayered" class="gen-params-group" hidden>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label">Row gap</span>
                <input id="genParamRowGap" type="range" min="150" max="800" step="10" />
                <span id="genParamRowGapValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">450%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label">Node height</span>
                <input id="genParamNodeH" type="range" min="100" max="400" step="5" />
                <span id="genParamNodeHValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">185%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label">Column gap</span>
                <input id="genParamColGap" type="range" min="0" max="60" step="1" />
                <span id="genParamColGapValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">10px</span>
              </div>
              <div class="gen-params-row">
                <span class="gen-params-label">Isolated column width</span>
                <input id="genParamIsoW" type="range" min="300" max="1500" step="10" />
                <span id="genParamIsoWValue" class="viz-ctrl-value">750%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gen-params-actions">
              <button type="button" id="genParamsReset" class="name-mode-btn">Reset spacing</button>
              <button type="button" id="genParamsExport" class="name-mode-btn">Export</button>
              <button type="button" id="genParamsImportBtn" class="name-mode-btn">Import</button>
              <input id="genParamsImportFile" type="file" accept="application/json" hidden />
            </div>
            <p id="genParamsStatus" class="small-note gen-params-status"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
        <p id="genEdgeInfo" class="small-note gen-edge-info">Hover or tap a family node or an influence arrow to see details. Right-click/long-press a node to filter the graph to it. Use the zoom controls, pinch, or Cmd/Ctrl + wheel inside the plot to adjust scale.</p>
        <div id="genLegend" class="viz-process-legend" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel view-panel" data-view="tables">
        <div class="view-header-row">
          <h2>All SQLite Tables</h2>
          <div class="view-header-actions">
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-filters="table">Hide filters</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-fullscreen-target="tables">Fullscreen</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="tableControlsWrap" class="view-controls-wrap">
        <div class="toolbar">
          <label class="toolbar-field">Table
            <select id="tableSelect"></select>
          </label>
          <label class="toolbar-field">Search selected table
            <input id="tableSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search all cells" autocomplete="off" />
          </label>
        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table id="allTablesView"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel view-panel" data-view="builder">
        <div class="view-header-row">
          <h2>Custom Query Builder</h2>
          <div class="view-header-actions">
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-filters="qb">Hide filters</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-toggle-layout="qb" aria-pressed="false">Filters on left</button>
            <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-fullscreen-target="builder">Fullscreen</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Base join: instances (primitive or mode) + families + reference links. Uses the same Fixed-length primitives / Variable-length modes filtering as the Timelines and Genealogy tabs. Component/round columns (family.component_ids, family.round_component_flow_signatures, family.round_state_models, family.round_hashes) let you find families that literally share a component or round structure via a query, instead of a hand-tagged relation — sort or filter on one of these to see which families line up.</p>
        <div class="view-body" id="qbViewBody">
        <div id="qbControlsWrap" class="view-controls-wrap">
        <div class="filter-sections-bar">
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-collapse-all="qb">Collapse all</button>
          <button type="button" class="view-toggle-btn" data-expand-all="qb">Expand all</button>
        </div>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Family filters</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body">
            <div id="qbTierFilterPanel"></div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="collapsible filter-section" open>
          <summary>Filters</summary>
          <div class="collapsible-body filters">
            <label>Reference kind
              <div id="fReferenceKind" class="filter-checklist"></div>
            </label>
            <div class="viz-year-controls">
              <label class="toolbar-field">From year
                <input id="fReferenceYearMin" type="range" />
              </label>
              <label class="toolbar-field">To year
                <input id="fReferenceYearMax" type="range" />
              </label>
              <button id="fReferenceYearReset" type="button">Reset years</button>
              <span id="fReferenceYearValue" class="small-note">All years</span>
            </div>
            <label>Family name contains
              <input id="fFamilyName" type="search" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
            <label>Reference title contains
              <input id="fReferenceTitle" type="search" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
            <label>Component id/name contains
              <input id="fComponentSearch" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. sbox, xor, field_matrix_mul" />
            </label>
            <label>Round component-flow signature contains
