          <p>This website was initially created from a large-scale AI-assisted crawl of academic papers, standards documents, and other public sources, and AI is routinely used to help retrieve, summarize, and cross-check the information presented here. Entries are checked against primary sources where possible, but the dataset has not yet undergone a full manual review by a human expert, and occasional errors or misattributions may remain.</p>
          <p class="small-note">Once a full manual review has been completed, this disclaimer will be updated to say so.</p>
